    "title": "Battery maker Natron closes shop, killing plans for 1,000 jobs in North Carolina - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jack Hagel ,\n8 hours ago Natron Energy, the California battery maker that last year announced plans to build a $1.4 billion factory in Edgecombe County, ceased operations Wednesday — a blow to the Rocky Mount area, which was expecting the project to create more than 1,000 jobs. The 13-year-old maker of industrial sodium-ion batteries... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 36",
